Use Case name: View and modify Cart 
Actor: Customer
Goal: The customer can view the added items in the cart, and modify the items by updating the quantity, adding a note to the restaurant with a special request, submit a voucher if the customer already have one.
Preconditions: The customer is authenticated by the applicaiton Login mechanism and a cart is previously created by the client after deciding on a certain item (meal) belonging to a specific restaurent.
Main Flow:
1- The customer open the application.
2- if the customer is not already authenticated and logged in He/ She is asked to provide his/ her credentials. 
3- If the customer is logged in successfully or stayed log in from a previous session He/ She can select the cart icon.
4- The selected restaurent name appears to the customers and Items already added to the cart are displayed with information communicating the name, price, and quatity.
5- The customer can increase or decrease the quantity, or delete each single added items.
6- The customer can update each item individually and customeize their meal choice, or quantity.
6- The cutomer can also add new items to the cart.
6- Suggestions of similar meals from the same restaurent are given to the user.
7- The customer can add any special request to the restaurant regarding the meal.
8- A payment summary is also displayed to the customer in the same page including (Delivery Fee, Service Fee, and Total Amount).


